{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1235384-area-overlooked","id":1235384,"title":"Area Overlooked","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-07-15T18:32:55-07:00","id":1235384,"title":"Area Overlooked","content":"So, something just came up: it was discovered during play that C20 accidentally left out a sizable portion of South-Eastern Europe in the Balkans and Carpathians. In particular, Slovakia, Hungary, Romanina, Bulgaria, Macedonia, Albania, Kosovo, Croatia, Bosnia, Moldava, and Serbia all seem to have been left out, but all of the areas around them are accounted for. Given that this very specific area seems to have been forgotten, I'm assuming that there was a write-up for it that accidentally failed to make it into the book?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T02:45:11-07:00","id":1235483,"title":"","content":"I think they just lump them in with the Hellenic Empire, the Empire of the Firebird, and what the Lands of the Caspian (wasn't that one larger then it should have been). But I would like some Kingdoms or duchies in the Cappadocian range. A lot of Europe was left out if I recall. And pretty much Asia and Africa.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T08:30:22-07:00","id":1235571,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Windthin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1235384-area-overlooked#post1235384\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, something just came up: it was discovered during play that C20 accidentally left out a sizable portion of South-Eastern Europe in the Balkans and Carpathians. In particular, Slovakia, Hungary, Romanina, Bulgaria, Macedonia, Albania, Kosovo, Croatia, Bosnia, Moldava, and Serbia all seem to have been left out, but all of the areas around them are accounted for. Given that this very specific area seems to have been forgotten, I'm assuming that there was a write-up for it that accidentally failed to make it into the book?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think they are in the Gallacian Confederation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-09T21:16:14-07:00","id":1252933,"title":"","content":"Yeah, once I started to look, I saw how much was either left out or lumped together. Made adjustments for that for my game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}